<node id="自定义Playwright插件">
  <data key="d0">自定义Playwright插件</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">自定义Playwright插件是对官方pytest-playwright插件的重写，旨在提供更灵活的控制，支持失败自动截图、录屏和Trace追踪。&lt;SEP&gt;重写了pytest-playwright插件，增加了额外功能。&lt;SEP&gt;一个重写的pytest-playwright插件，实现了失败自动截图、Trace追踪、视频录制和Allure集成等增强功能。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-713d53fa915224637d4b450019cfe610&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ee95678b86c9b568620faa3f642a99f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-337c99f0d9f1f9baf228abe482019a62</data>
  <data key="d4">PlayWrightUI 自动化面试.md</data>
